You may:
- Download, install and use this software for free for personal use.
- Share links to the official download page.

Without the author's written permission, you may not:
- Decompile, disassemble, unpack (e.g. extract app.asar) or otherwise reverse engineer this software.
- Copy, modify or translate this software in whole or in part, or create derivative works based on it.
