- Remove or alter any copyright notice in this software.

This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The author is not liable for any damages arising from its use.

Third-party components included with this software (such as FFmpeg, Electron and other open-source packages) are provided under their own licenses and are not subject to the restrictions above; their license texts are included in the installation folder.

Third-party notices and disclaimer:
- ReFlo is an unofficial, fan-made tool. It is not affiliated with, authorised, sponsored or endorsed by any game developer, publisher or operator. Game names, trademarks, images and game footage belong to their respective owners.
- ReFlo does not modify any game program or game files, does not read or write a game's memory, and does not intercept or alter a game's network traffic; it records what is on the user's own screen and speakers.
- RivaTuner Statistics Server (RTSS) is software of its author. ReFlo does not include it, is not affiliated with it and is not endorsed by it; it only reads data RTSS provides after the user has installed and started it.
- When recording, editing and sharing game footage, follow the terms of service and material-usage guidelines of each game and platform. Whether to use this software, and every consequence of doing so, is the user's own decision and responsibility; the author accepts no liability.
